-- Tier weapons scale a step ahead of armor and jewelry (2026-11-12): fixed stats are the Legendary source x
-- 1.5 / 2.0 / 2.5 / 3.0 / 3.5 at gear tiers 1-5 (was 1.0 / 1.5 / 2.0 / 2.5 / 3.0), and the random-roll strength
-- (dynamic_items.stat_multiplier) moves by the same ratio. Same rounding as gen_tier_gear.py scaled_copy().
-- Covers every class copy of the 32 weapons, shields and range items; tier arrows are untouched.
-- Items load through shared_memory: restart after applying. Items players own pick up the new base stats.

START TRANSACTION;
